W AX3039 346-axtag-key-typo.ax:21:6-13 axtag-key-typo "AXTAG key typo on `slipped`: unrecognised key `efect`; did you mean `effect`?" ?"an unrecognised key is recorded and never checked, so the claim this looks like was not made; the keys that are checked are `effect(...)` (purity is `effect(pure)`), `restrict(...)`, `pre(...)`, `post(...)`, `isr` and `unhandled(trap)` on an `effect` declaration"
